{"parentUuid":"7a77ae9f-69df-43c8-b0ff-3ab9bd6e2c06","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019fxisaVkx5PcJwhSvBkaXw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Mise supports `.env` files natively via `mise.toml` configuration:\n\n```toml\n# mise.toml\n[env]\n_.file = \".env\"\n```\n\nThis loads variables from `.env` into any task or shell activated by mise.\n\nYou can also specify multiple files or environment-specific files:\n\n```toml\n[env]\n_.file = [\".env\", \".env.local\"]\n```\n\nOther useful patterns:\n\n- **Inline variables** alongside `.env` files:\n  ```toml\n  [env]\n  _.file = \".env\"\n  MY_VAR = \"value\"\n  ```\n\n- **Conditional/directory-scoped**: Place a `mise.toml` with `_.file = \".env\"` in a subdirectory and it applies only there.\n\n- **Template support** in env values:\n  ```toml\n  [env]\n  DATABASE_URL = \"postgres://localhost/{{env.DB_NAME}}\"\n  ```\n\nRun `mise env` to verify which variables are loaded in the current directory."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":30916,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":330,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":30916,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CZQb5XBQnp2kmUkgkViCN","type":"assistant","uuid":"0d5f174f-8644-40d4-bc71-148ad507ecb1","timestamp":"2026-03-25T22:29:25.251Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/pfleidi/entire/cli/.worktrees/feat/checkpoints-v2-refs/.worktrees/feat/checkpoints-v2-transcript-rotation","sessionId":"26969584-ef34-4b96-bef1-6363267aa26c","version":"2.1.83","gitBranch":"feat/checkpoints-v2-transcript-rotation"}
